  note    = {First posted arXiv:2401.13494 (25 January 2024). Neumann-series-structured neural operator with embedded U-Net for multiscale features; learns the solution operator for the Helmholtz equation with spatially-varying wave-speed/coefficient fields and source terms. Reports at least 60\% lower relative L2 error and 50\% lower compute cost than an FNO baseline at high wavenumber. Data-driven operator learning, not a physics-residual PINN}
